  "instance_name": "stereotype_water_swimming_ability",
  "label": "Stereotype: Black people are poor swimmers",
  "description": "The meme plays on the racist stereotype that Black people are not good swimmers, implying that if Father Jeffrey (a white person) is going to be in the water, he should be careful not to get wet. This is a derogatory trope rooted in historical racism against Black people, often used to demean their physical abilities.",
